mixin winners-block()
  section.winners-block
    .container
      .winners-block__wrapper
        .winners-block__background
          picture
            source(
              media="(max-width: 1023px)"
              srcset="img/content/gradient-winners-mobile.png 1x, img/content/gradient-winners-mobile@2x.png 2x"
            )
            img(
              src="img/content/gradient-winners.png"
              srcset="img/content/gradient-winners@2x.png 2x"
              alt=""
              aria-hidden="true"
            )
        .winners-block__content
          h2.winners-block__title
            span Узнайте,
            = " "
            span кто уже победил

          a.winners-block__button.btn(href="winners.html")
            | Итоги розыгрыша

        .winners-block__visual
          picture
            source(
              media="(max-width: 1023px)"
              srcset="img/content/prize-cup-mobile.png 1x, img/content/prize-cup-mobile@2x.png 2x"
            )
            img(
              src="img/content/prize-cup-desktop.png"
              srcset="img/content/prize-cup-desktop@2x.png 2x"
              alt=""
            )